// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P754010298" "You don't know what you've done."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4049557618" "You're in for a world of hurt when my team gets here."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P337355820" "Let...me....go!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3601334529" "This will end very...very...badly for you!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3166218277" "This is just the beginning."

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTEE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2468676803" "Dumb move, punk.  I can handle myself."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTEE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2328987433" "Either way, one of us is going down.  The cloaks or you."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTEE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2195681965" "Lesson number one.  No honor among foes."

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1410096634" "The persecution ends tonight, arachnid."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P248496322" "Now we enact our revenge.  We have plans for you."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1866771732" "The evening is only just beginning.  It will get worse, I assure you."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1311479870" "First the interrogation.  And then...sweet retribution."
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1993670040" "One soldier cannot make up for the massacre you have inflicted on us.  But...it is a start."

// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2856993865" "Interruptions!  Take care of it!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4266906237" "This is not over!"
// OAKES_FORTBLOOD_ABDUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3439671340" "Insolence!  Take care of it!"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1266934097" "Use your senses, gentlemen.  Keep a strong watch."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P69809022" "Did you hear that?"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3257829145" "Bows at the ready, gentlemen."

