// SHARKHEAD_CEREMONY_INCANTATION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1382236910" "And so it begins..."
// SHARKHEAD_CEREMONY_INCANTATION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2859930244" "The secrets stored within these ancient pages will be ours!"

