// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2539043541" "In time, the souls wandering Sharkhead shall be ours."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3150264048" "We must catch more Scrapyarders. They have nothing to live for anyway."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3352849121" "A decisive strike is in order."

// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1500818489" "Get them!  More ripe souls for the taking!"
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3739732759" "Nothing can stop us."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_COT_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2926606658" "Fool!  You don't know what you're doing!"

// SHARKHEAD_INTERROGATE_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P875216542" "Struggle all you wish.  It will do you no good."
// SHARKHEAD_INTERROGATE_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P423731407" "There is no information that I cannot extract from you.  You'd do well to remember that."
// SHARKHEAD_INTERROGATE_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3486636207" "Oh, my dear, the pain is just beginning.  Telling me what I want to know would be a very wise idea."
// SHARKHEAD_INTERROGATE_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2190112134" "Sigh.  You waste my time.  In the end, it will cost you dearly."
// SHARKHEAD_INTERROGATE_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P476628982" "I like it when they struggle. It makes it more fun. For me."

