// SHARKHEAD_RESEARCH_GUARDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2957082744" "Prepare yourselves, brothers.  The binding will soon begin."
// SHARKHEAD_RESEARCH_GUARDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P589464878" "The ancient texts will guide us.  They always have."
// SHARKHEAD_RESEARCH_GUARDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3225595052" "Patience.  All knowledge will come to us soon."

// SHARKHEAD_RESEARCH_RESEARCHER_ALERTED_TEXT :
