// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_HOLDTORCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P963861847" "Hold your torches high.  Let all in Potter's Field know we are near."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_HOLDTORCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3622141429" "Keep the flames high.  We will make our presence felt here in Potter's Field."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_HOLDTORCH_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1052640686" "Let the flames serve as a reminder that the Circle of Thorns are coming."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_HOLDTORCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3282649277" "Strange.  I heard something."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_HOLDTORCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1062134643" "Hmm...  What was that?"
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_LOITER_HOLDTORCH_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1243515880" "One moment.  I'm going to go investigate something."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_MEDITATE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4094667136" "Yes...I see it now.  Very good."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_MEDITATE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1972817814" "The texts are so clear in my mind.  The words resonate."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_MEDITATE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1037685284" "Ahh...of course.  It is as I thought."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_MEDITATE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P527266328" "You dare to interrupt me in meditation!"
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_MEDITATE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3836652130" "You will weep for the end when I am through with you!"
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_MEDITATE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1276770456" "There will be no reprieve from the endless pain I will cause you!"
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_MEDITATE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3684612840" "Ah!  The connection has been broken!  YOU...  You will pay!"

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_READINGSCRIPTURES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3768175930" "How incredibly interesting..."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_READINGSCRIPTURES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P181600644" "Curious.  I never noticed that piece before."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_READINGSCRIPTURES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1952283849" "This...this can't be...  Oh wait...yes.  Good.  Very good.  I see now."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_READINGSCRIPTURES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P832871329" "How very curious..."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_READINGSCRIPTURES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P260950576" "These texts...so powerful..."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_READINGSCRIPTURES_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1405782859" "Your eyes have set upon this parchment.  The price is your life."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_READINGSCRIPTURES_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1319868974" "No one but the Thorns may view the ancient texts and live to tell about it."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_READINGSCRIPTURES_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1992074741" "Your curiosity has sealed your doom."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_READINGSCRIPTURES_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1648178841" "You have made a mistake that will cost you dearly."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_READSCROLLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3745877371" "These scrolls...fascinating."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_READSCROLLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3201010588" "The scrolls are clear.  We're on the right path.  We must forge ahead."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_READSCROLLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1786705997" "It is as I thought.  The scrolls confirm our research."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_READSCROLLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1137265046" "You should not be here!"
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_READSCROLLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P236122865" "When I am through with you, you will wish you had never lived."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_READSCROLLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1289769765" "You will pay a dear price for your curiosity."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4028416021" "The books speak of our task ahead.  I can see it."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3165446203" "These books provide much information."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4010404127" "Excellent.  These books confirm the research."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1214508709" "Very good.  I see our task clearly now.  These texts confirm everything."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3243618380" "Books.  Be gone!"
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3882952086" "Books.  Away!"
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P436800456" "You have made a mistake!"
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_RESEARCH_FLOATINGBOOKS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1487849686" "Your presence is a mockery to all we are trying to accomplish!"

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4120025054" "Ah, how precious.  The soul in this one struggles."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2797431446" "Easy there.  It will do you no good to struggle.  I will take what I want.  Your soul is mine."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3732248479" "Shhh...don't struggle.  It will only cause you more pain."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2723421235" "Do not struggle, mutant.  I WILL get your soul."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P587645095" "Freakshow has no need of souls.  You barely use your brains.  I hardly think you would miss either."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P159161079" "All the bolts and electricity in the Rogue Isles will not keep your soul from me.  Resisting me is a waste of time."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_SCRAPYARDER_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2327661706" "Stop..."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_SCRAPYARDER_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1274916894" "You will...not...get...my...soul..."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_SCRAPYARDER_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2812713321" "No..."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_SCRAPYARDER_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1199226998" "Unh... Free..."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_SCRAPYARDER_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P189467554" "The pain..."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_SCRAPYARDER_VICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3882000564" "I'm...yes...free!"

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_SCRAPYARDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3027114668" "Easy, Scrapyarder.  I will have what I need from you.  Do not resist."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_SCRAPYARDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P133416382" "Such a greasy unkempt body, but the soul is strong.  It will serve me well."
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_SCRAPYARDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2521569462" "Shhh...you struggle too much, Scrapyarder.  It will only cause you more pain to resist."

// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_SCRAPYARDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3723596013" "Intrusion!  I can't keep the link!  You will pay!"
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_SCRAPYARDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3836081869" "Aaagh...!  The connection is broken!  Who--?  YOU!"
// SHARKHEAD_POTTERSFIELD_SOULTAKE_SCRAPYARDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3837233796" "You there!  You will pay for the interruption!"

// STM_ANCIENT_BOOK_OWNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2377271479" "Interesting.  Very...very...interesting."
// STM_ANCIENT_BOOK_OWNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P64654912" "Ah, I think I can use this.  Now to determine exactly how..."
// STM_ANCIENT_BOOK_OWNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3418476149" "Hm...  I can use this."
// STM_ANCIENT_BOOK_OWNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P575480094" "Ahhh...the mystery begins to focus...  I had no idea..."

// STM_ANCIENT_BOOK_OWNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1121896164" "You will not learn the secrets contained here!"
// STM_ANCIENT_BOOK_OWNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2316733597" "You have overstepped your welcome!"
// STM_ANCIENT_BOOK_OWNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1061441628" "You are not welcome here!"
// STM_ANCIENT_BOOK_OWNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P363051388" "You will die!"

// STM_BONFIRE_CASTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2924704136" "Higher.  It must be higher."
// STM_BONFIRE_CASTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1702684806" "Yes.  Higher.  That's it."
// STM_BONFIRE_CASTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1005798415" "Higher.  The fire must be higher."

// STM_BONFIRE_CASTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1019910853" "You will burn!"
// STM_BONFIRE_CASTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1908743920" "You will pay dearly."
// STM_BONFIRE_CASTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4130617538" "Your time has come.  It will end now."

// STM_INSCRIPTIONS_SUCCUBUS_READER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1937736523" "Ah...this tells me what I need to know."
// STM_INSCRIPTIONS_SUCCUBUS_READER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P188985031" "And now I understand."
// STM_INSCRIPTIONS_SUCCUBUS_READER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2470745261" "I see.  It is so clear now."
// STM_INSCRIPTIONS_SUCCUBUS_READER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4148483603" "This will aid in my collection of souls."

// STM_INSCRIPTIONS_SUCCUBUS_READER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P726212334" "No!"
// STM_INSCRIPTIONS_SUCCUBUS_READER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P261808258" "Quickly!  Hide the texts!"
// STM_INSCRIPTIONS_SUCCUBUS_READER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4221349933" "Get them!"

// STM_INSCRIPTIONS_BOOK_READER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P442584462" "She will be pleased with this, I think."
// STM_INSCRIPTIONS_BOOK_READER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3337077476" "Oh how interesting..."
// STM_INSCRIPTIONS_BOOK_READER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2849120601" "This...I did not expect."

// STM_INSCRIPTIONS_BOOK_READER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1289696115" "You are not worthy of seeing these texts!"

// STM_RESEARCH_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2047661377" "Soon.  It will become clear."
// STM_RESEARCH_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1634444232" "I have patience.  All will be revealed in time."
// STM_RESEARCH_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3217286234" "I am ready."

// STM_RESEARCH_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3671280854" "You!  Get out!"
// STM_RESEARCH_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2904038148" "We're not alone!"
// STM_RESEARCH_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3665565890" "Put it away!  We have an intruder!"

// STM_SOULSIPHON_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3995216777" "This one has a strong will.  It will be so much sweeter when its soul is yours."
// STM_SOULSIPHON_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1589215201" "It struggles quite valiantly.  How sweet."
// STM_SOULSIPHON_WATCHER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1575076639" "It struggles so magnificently.  Foolish, but sweet."

// STM_SOULSIPHON_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1985870333" "No!  You will not interfere!"
// STM_SOULSIPHON_WATCHER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3893553295" "Cease!"

// STM_ABDUCTION_CASTINGHOLDSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2778327088" "I have it.  It fights, but it is stable."
// STM_ABDUCTION_CASTINGHOLDSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P536372638" "Ah, this one struggles, as you say.  I have it held fast."
// STM_ABDUCTION_CASTINGHOLDSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1759872400" "Yes...it's struggling.  Let me strengthen the hold on it."

// STM_ABDUCTION_CASTINGSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P500731854" "I have it, too."
// STM_ABDUCTION_CASTINGSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2883165301" "Keep casting, it's fighting us."
// STM_ABDUCTION_CASTINGSPELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1253846881" "Don't falter, it struggles."

// STM_ABDUCTION_VICTIMNPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P651114757" "My...soul..."

// STM_ABDUCTION_VICTIMNPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3167645658" "Must...get...away..."
// STM_ABDUCTION_VICTIMNPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P197723882" "Free...run...run!"
// STM_ABDUCTION_VICTIMNPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3693131014" "Oh...must get out of here..."

// STM_ABDUCTION_CASTINGHOLDSPELL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2796506875" "Intruder!  My concentration's broken!"
// STM_ABDUCTION_CASTINGHOLDSPELL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2807288229" "It's getting away!  I couldn't keep holding it!"
// STM_ABDUCTION_CASTINGHOLDSPELL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P685184996" "Stop!  No!  The spell is broken!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P977177221" "Arachnos will not be defeated by the likes of you.  Mu!  Strike!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3401734666" "You aren't even a blip on my radar, Circle of Thorns!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2909570454" "That all you got?  Those spell-casting arms get caught in your robes?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1515482954" "Weak!  Circle of Thorns!  So weak!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3283020120" "Intruders!  Take them, too!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4174455723" "We'll take you on, too!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3978122569" "Your sense of timing is gonna get you killed!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2019340961" "Arachnos will bulldoze you, too!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1987429603" "The Circle of Thorns has no fear of you.  Let this battle be a reminder of our power!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P104014224" "You have no idea the scope of our power!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2712846432" "Arachnos!  You are fools!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2664913750" "You are all fools and you will die!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_COT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P880826683" "This is not your fight!  You will die as well!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_COT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3079410536" "You make a very deadly mistake walking in on this battle!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D5_COT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P211165727" "You are irrelevant!"



// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_COTMU_D6_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3747150499" "You speak of miscasts!  You whose arms are bound!"










